# Frontend implementation rules

Follow `spec/frontend.md` and `spec/api.md`.

- React + Vite only; no authentication UI
- Call backend REST APIs; do not invent endpoints
- Show meaningful API errors, loading, and empty states
- Status UI offers only valid next transitions; backend remains source of truth
- `VITE_API_BASE_URL` via env; never commit secrets
- Do not modify backend unless a genuine API blocker is found
